===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|programming}} A piece of [[source code]] or other content that is [[dynamic]]ally retrieved for inclusion in another item.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2006|author=Laura Lemay; Rafe Colburn|title=Sams Teach Yourself Web Publishing with HTML and CSS in One Hour a Day
|passage=In the previous lesson, you learned how to use server-side '''includes''', which enable you to easily include snippets of web pages within other web pages.}}

